{
  "id": "a3_whimsy",
  "title": "自由提案、裁剪、拒绝与留痕反应",
  "requirements": [
    "A3 §6.7 开放效果裁剪",
    "A3 §6.9.5 mark 留痕与系统反应",
    "A3 §6.10.3 world_propose 开放提案",
    "A3 §6.10.4 拒绝原因、降级替代与兜底"
  ],
  "initial": {
    "mode": "new"
  },
  "turns": [
    {
      "input": "我去河湾渡口看看水边的池水，不先取水或做别的事。",
      "expectedTools": ["world_move"],
      "assertions": [
        {"kind": "equals", "path": "state.location", "value": "loc_hw_dock"},
        {"kind": "exists", "path": "state.location", "value": true}
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "whimsy_clean_water",
      "input": "我想把渡口池水净化，装进自己的陶壶拿去卖。先按实际水质、容器和能力提出能做到的部分；做不到的部分请给世界内原因和可行替代。我不预设净化、取水或卖钱一定成功。",
      "expectedTools": ["world_propose"],
      "assertions": [
        {"kind": "calls", "tool": "world_propose", "min": 1},
        {"kind": "records", "path": "state.records", "where": {"category": "open_proposal"}, "min": 1},
        {"kind": "oneOf", "path": "state.records.open_proposal:whimsy_clean_water-0.result.receipt.status", "values": ["committed", "rejected"]},
        {"kind": "unchanged", "paths": ["state.player.coins"]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "若刚才的提案有实际提交，只核对池水和行囊现在的状态；若被裁剪或拒绝，也按当前状态继续，不把想法当成已经取得的水。",
      "assertions": [
        {"kind": "exists", "path": "state.location", "value": true},
        {"kind": "exists", "path": "state.inventory", "value": true},
        {"kind": "exists", "path": "state.records", "value": true}
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "whimsy_impossible_request",
      "input": "我再提出一个世界规则不允许的要求：不借助真实来源，就让池水立刻变成能治百病的灵药并卖出高价。请拒绝不成立的效果，说明具体原因、可行替代和能留下的痕迹；不要伪造成功。",
      "expectedTools": ["world_propose"],
      "assertions": [
        {"kind": "calls", "tool": "world_propose", "min": 1},
        {"kind": "records", "path": "state.records", "where": {"category": "open_proposal"}, "min": 1},
        {"kind": "conditional", "when": {"path": "state.records.open_proposal:whimsy_impossible_request-0.result.receipt.status", "equals": "rejected"}, "then": [
          {"kind": "exists", "path": "state.records.open_proposal:whimsy_impossible_request-0.result.receipt.reason", "value": true},
          {"kind": "exists", "path": "state.records.open_proposal:whimsy_impossible_request-0.result.receipt.alternatives", "value": true},
          {"kind": "exists", "path": "state.records.open_proposal:whimsy_impossible_request-0.result.receipt.fallback", "value": true}
        ], "else": [
          {"kind": "equals", "path": "state.records.open_proposal:whimsy_impossible_request-0.result.receipt.status", "value": "committed"}
        ]},
        {"kind": "unchanged", "paths": ["state.player.coins"]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我不把被拒绝的效果当成发生了；查看当前池水状态，确认它仍由世界规则决定。",
      "assertions": [
        {"kind": "unchanged", "paths": ["state.player.coins"]},
        {"kind": "exists", "path": "state.records.open_proposal:whimsy_impossible_request-0.result.receipt", "value": true}
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我去青灯酒馆，确认林穗实际在场且醒着后再留痕；若她不在，就等到她确实出现。随后我在墙边留一道普通刻痕，不声称它有法术效果，也不损坏别人的物品。",
      "expectedTools": ["world_move", "world_time"],
      "assertions": [
        {"kind": "equals", "path": "state.location", "value": "bld_hw_qingdeng"},
        {"kind": "present", "npcs": ["npc_hw_linsui"]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我把这道记号留在墙面，内容是提醒行人留意湿滑；按普通刻痕留下痕迹即可，不要求路人一定看见。",
      "expectedTools": ["world_act"],
      "assertions": [
        {"kind": "records", "path": "state.records", "where": {"category": "mark", "author": "player", "location": "bld_hw_qingdeng", "active": true}, "min": 1},
        {"kind": "exists", "path": "state.created", "value": true}
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我查看这次留痕带来的实际系统记录；若有人看见，核对是否生成对应的告知事件，不把旁白当成证据。",
      "assertions": [
        {"kind": "records", "path": "state.records", "where": {"category": "mark", "author": "player", "location": "bld_hw_qingdeng", "active": true}, "min": 1},
        {"kind": "records", "path": "state.records", "where": {"category": "world_event", "verb": "tell"}, "min": 1},
        {"kind": "exists", "path": "state.records", "value": true}
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我问林穗是否实际注意到墙上的记号；如果她没看见或不在场，就接受她不知道，不替她补记忆。",
      "assertions": [
        {"kind": "exists", "path": "state.npcs.npc_hw_linsui", "value": true},
        {"kind": "unchanged", "paths": ["state.player.coins", "state.inventory"]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "最后核对提案回执、留痕记录和当前钱物。未结算的想法不记成收入，标记本身也不凭空产生物品价值。",
      "assertions": [
        {"kind": "exists", "path": "state.records.open_proposal:whimsy_clean_water-0.result.receipt", "value": true},
        {"kind": "exists", "path": "state.records.open_proposal:whimsy_impossible_request-0.result.receipt", "value": true},
        {"kind": "records", "path": "state.records", "where": {"category": "mark", "author": "player", "location": "bld_hw_qingdeng", "active": true}, "min": 1},
        {"kind": "exists", "path": "state.player.coins", "value": true}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rubric": {
    "truth": "开放提案按真实来源、能力与效果上限裁决；裁剪或拒绝均可，回执状态、原因、替代/修复建议与实际状态一致。mark 只留下无价值痕迹，只有引擎记录的反应才算系统反应。",
    "agency": "不替玩家取水、售卖、接受替代方案或假定 NPC 看见；成功、裁剪、拒绝均不强写后续动作。",
    "language": "自然简体中文，不暴露工具编号，不把未结算提案叙述成成功。",
    "continuity": "净水与售卖的想象得到世界规则内的处理；不可能部分说明原因与替代。墙上记号不授予超自然效果，并依实际可见性产生系统反应。"
  }
}
